The main objective of the present study is to replicate previous work by Poarch and Van Hell (
2012a
), using the same task types and experimental set-up (Simon and Flanker), with a very similar population from the same environment (second language learners, bilinguals and bilingual third language learners), and in an extension, to also focus on children from a wider age range.

